      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effect of cerebral electrotherapy (CET) on the pain threshold was investigated in 3 test persons, on 5 points of the neck of these persons. Altogether 1200 algesimetric measurements were performed. The statistical evaluation showed a significant tedency (p less than 0.01) towards an elevation of the pain threshold by CET."},
